  "description": "The transcripts of Mohammed (the Quran speech to text data): each record is a recording, named by its path in the download's audio_data directory, with its duration in seconds and the Arabic text recited. The table's rows are read from transcripts.tsv, which the download's own description gives as a path, a duration and the text; all_ayat.json, whose text is of each verse and not of a recording, is not read. It carries none of the audio, which the download list of openslr-slr132 gives.",
